{"id":"area:kashmir","kind":"area","name":"Kashmir","name_zh":"克什米尔","geo":{"poly":[[73.0,33.0],[73.5,32.5],[75.3,32.3],[76.4,32.8],[78.4,32.5],[79.5,32.5],[80.3,35.4],[78.0,35.8],[77.0,35.9],[75.8,36.8],[74.5,37.0],[73.0,36.8],[72.5,35.0]]},"intro":"Valleys and plateaus at the western end of the Himalaya, ruled by Hindu, Buddhist and Muslim dynasties, and a princely state under British India from 1846.","intro_zh":"喜马拉雅西端的山谷与高原，印度教、佛教、伊斯兰教王朝先后统治，1846年起为英属印度下的土邦。","notes":[{"from":1947,"to":2026,"zh":"1947年起被印度、巴基斯坦分别控制，双方都主张全境；阿克赛钦由中国控制，印度主张。地图按实际控制绘制。","en":"Since 1947 divided between India and Pakistan, each claiming the whole; Aksai Chin is held by China and claimed by India. The map shows who controls what.","disputed":true}]}
